      "What does a trust boundary represent in a model?|A change in trust assumptions|Every drawn component edge~Some component transitions do not change the represented trust assumptions.|Only a different building~Authority boundaries can exist within one building or process network.|Only a public website’s border~Internal services can cross important authorization boundaries.|A trust boundary marks where assumptions, authority or validation requirements change.",
